{"id":"e2c063fa8aba9ee9","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-lem-name-evaluation.md","title":"Name Evaluation","display":"lem-name-evaluation — Name Evaluation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-name-evaluation","aliases":["58-lem-name-evaluation"],"display":"lem-name-evaluation — Name Evaluation","depends_on":["[[58-df-name]]","[[58-df-name-evaluation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-name-evaluation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-name-evaluation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-name-evaluation — Name Evaluation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"58-df-name-evaluation\">58-df-name-evaluation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,G,\\tau,x\\in V\">\\(P,G,\\tau,x\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq P\">\\(G\\subseteq P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\)</span> are the exact source predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\to\\exists!x\\in V\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\to\\exists!x\\in V\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Existence and uniqueness follow by well-founded recursion on name rank. Genericity is not required for evaluating a name; it is required only for forcing-extension semantics.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-name","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-name-evaluation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,G,\\tau,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\to\\exists!x\\in V\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P).","display":true}],"bytes":800,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3914","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-lem-name-evaluation.md|58-lem-name-evaluation]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["ec28b62254928d73","0c40d420e5118724"]}